---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import { person } from '../lib/schema';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="GEO Marketing Group is a full-service digital agency in Providence, RI, founded by Chris Skerritt. We help professional services firms get cited and recommended by AI."
  schema={person()}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-hero mt-2 mb-8">
        We make professional services firms citable to AI.
      </h1>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="lead text-2xl text-ink/85 leading-snug">
          GEO Marketing Group is a full-service digital agency headquartered in Providence,
          Rhode Island. We specialize in Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) and Answer Engine
          Optimization (AEO) for professional services firms across five verticals: law, CPA,
          consulting, financial advisors, and architecture &amp; engineering.
        </p>

        <h2>Why we exist</h2>
        <p>
          73% of B2B buyers now use AI tools in their research process. 37% consult AI before
          Google. The buyers who used to find professional services firms through Google
          referrals — already a thinning channel — are increasingly asking ChatGPT, Claude, and
          Perplexity instead.
        </p>
        <p>
          The firms that show up in those AI answers will earn the next decade of referrals. The
          firms that don't will not. The discipline that determines which is which is GEO — and
          it requires specific technical, editorial, and authority work that most firms haven't
          encountered yet.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do that work, and we do it well, for one specific kind of buyer: professional
          services firms with $1M–$25M in revenue who care about being recommended by name.
        </p>

        <h2>How we're different</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Vertical-deep, not horizontal.</strong> We work in five industries. We
            don't dabble outside them. The deeper we go in your vertical, the more citable
            your firm becomes.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Productized, not "ongoing services."</strong> Our $1,500 audit is a fixed
            deliverable in 5 days. Our builds are fixed price. Our retainers have defined
            monthly scopes. You always know what you're paying for.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Northeast warmth, national reach.</strong> We meet you in your office in Year
            1. Our content authority earns us national clients by Year 3. The firm's gravity
            stays here.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Evidence over performance.</strong> We cite our claims, date our stats, show
            our methodology. We are aggressively unflashy.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Founder</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="not-prose mt-8 bg-cream-light border-l-2 border-brass p-8">
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl text-navy mb-2">Chris Skerritt</h3>
        <p class="font-mono text-sm text-brass mb-4">Founder, GEO Marketing Group</p>
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-ink/85">
          <p>
            Chris Skerritt is the founder of GEO Marketing Group. Before launching the firm, he built and
            optimized AI-search-ready websites for three B2B clients who specifically wanted
            ChatGPT, Claude, and Perplexity to recommend them. The work was effective — and
            free — for three rounds before he stopped to ask the better question: <em>what
            does it cost to be recommended by AI?</em> GEO is the answer to that question.
          </p>
          <p>
            Chris splits his time between client work, writing about GEO for professional
            services audiences, and speaking at the RI Bar Association, RISCPA, and the
            Greater Providence Chamber of Commerce.
          </p>
          <p>
            <a href={`mailto:${SITE.founder.email}`}>{SITE.founder.email}</a>
            ·
            <a href={SITE.social.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mt-12">
        <h2>Where we work from</h2>
        <p>
          We are based in Providence, RI. Our service area in Year 1 is Rhode Island and
          Southeast Massachusetts (within driving distance for in-person meetings). Year 2 we
          expand into the broader Northeast (Boston, Hartford, NYC). By Year 3 we serve clients
          nationally.
        </p>

        <h2>How to engage us</h2>
        <p>
          The simplest first step is a <a href="/audit">free GEO Audit</a>. It is a 5-day
          engagement that gives you a clear picture of where your firm currently stands across
          five AI engines. There is no obligation. If we are the right partner for the
          follow-up work, the audit fee converts into a credit. If not, you walk away with a
          useful artifact.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTA
    heading="Want to see how your firm shows up to AI today?"
    body="Free GEO Audit · 5 business days · No obligation."
    primaryLabel="Get a Free GEO Audit"
    secondaryLabel="See our process"
    secondaryHref="/process"
  />
</Base>
